{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1600055140"}, "name":{"label":"Anneliese's comments"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-12T20:44:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.742.1053"}, "id":{"label":"14660268184"}, "title":{"label":"Buy Roblox Now!"}, "content":{"label":"Roblox is an online platform where there the players of the games can create games for other players to join and play. When making an account, there's some great perks! First, you can only access the account if you have a passcode; I've never been hacked. Also, there's age verification, so you're playing with people your age. If you're worried, there is also parental controls so that the user stays safe and has limited access per day so when the time runs out they have to wait until tomorrow. If you want to get Robux, (via online money) 1.00$ equals ONE HUNDRED ROBUX!!🤩✨\nThis is really fun and you can add players as friends your age!! I really recommend for 10-25 yrs old!!\nI have been playing for around 4 years and I have so many new friends and discovered a new part of me because of these kind people. You can only play if you have wi-fi, so maybe wait until you get off your airplane.\nHave an amazing time playing this game!\n-Anneliese 🌀🩷🫶", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=431946152&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
